    "q-111386": {
      "dom_id": "step-q111386",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "If $P(x)$ and $Q(x)$ are polynomials of degree $4$ and $8,$ respectively, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $P+Q$ is a polynomial of degree $8$\n\nII. $P\\cdot Q$ is a polynomial of degree $32$\n\nIII. $\\frac{Q}{P}$ is a polynomial of degree $4$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. The highest-degree terms in $P$ and $Q$ must contain ${x}^{4}$ and ${x}^{8},$ respectively. Since there is no ${x}^{8}$ term in $P$ that could possibly cancel the ${x}^{8}$ term in $Q,$ the leading term in $P+Q,$ still contains ${x}^{8}.$ Therefore, the degree of $P+Q$ must always be $8.$\n\n- Statement II is false. Since the highest-degree terms in $P$ and $Q$ must contain ${x}^{4}$ and ${x}^{8},$ respectively, the highest-degree term in $P\\cdot Q$ must contain ${x}^{4}\\cdot {x}^{8}={x}^{4+8}={x}^{12},$ meaning that $P\\cdot Q$ has degree $12.$\n\n- Statement III is false. For example, suppose $P={x}^{4}$ and $Q={x}^{8}+1.$ Then, $\\frac{Q}{P}=\\frac{{x}^{8}+1}{{x}^{4}}={x}^{4}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}},$ which is not a polynomial.\n\nIn conclusion, only statement I is true.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-111386-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "html": " II only"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-111386-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and III only",
              "html": " I and III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-111386-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "html": " III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-111386-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only",
